        "zh": "资料列出的球门尺寸为92 × 64 × 48 cm，球直径14 cm。设置两座球门时，应把中间跑动范围与球门后方的捡球空间一起考虑。",
        "en": "The listed goal dimensions are 92 × 64 × 48 cm, with a 14 cm ball. Allow for movement between the goals and space behind them to retrieve the ball."
      }
    },
